# Note: output/*.csv are small (<120 KB each) and are tracked intentionally
# so README screenshots/links keep working for portfolio viewers. If the
# simulation is re-run with much longer t_max or higher sample_hz and the
# CSVs grow large, consider adding "output/*.csv" here and using Git LFS
# or regenerating them via run_all.py instead of committing them.
